<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - South African June CPI up 8.8 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>TABLE - South African June CPI up 8.8 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's all-items consumer price index rose 0.3 percent in June from May after rising 0.3 percent in May, the Central Statistical Service said.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise was 8.8 percent versus May's 9.5 percent.</p>
<p>A Reuters consensus poll of economists forecast a 0.5 percent month-on-month increase and a 9.1 percent year-on-year rise.</p>
</text>
